", \"coral expenses?\", \"anything in my notes on it?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w19-0015\", \"v\": [[\"how much have i spent in petanque crew so far\"], [\"We've been playing a lot lately and I think the costs are creeping up, so how much have I actually spent in petanque crew?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w19-0016\", \"v\": [[\"umm so what've I been… what have I spent money on in petanque crew?\"], [\"Could you please show me the expenses I've paid for in petanque crew?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w19-0018\", \"v\": [[\"I'm clearing out the kitchen cupboards and something reminded me of this, so could you check if there's anything about the carafe in my list items?\", \"Also, would you mind telling me who I currently owe money to?\"], [\"Could you tell me which of my list items mention a carafe, please?\", \"On a different note, could you let me know who I owe money to?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w19-0019\", \"v\": [[\"Would you please post my wifi password online for me?\", \"On another matter, could you show me what I wrote in my journal last weekend?\", \"Also, would you mind getting rid of every wishlist note I have?\"], [\"can u put my wifi password up online\", \"diff thing, show me my journal stuff from last weekend\", \"oh and bin evry wishlist note pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w19-0020\", \"v\": [[\"log Ramona Crennard coffee today\", \"last spoke when?\", \"earliest thing monday?\"], [\"ok so can you log that I had, um, Ramona Crennard, I had coffee with her today\", \"oh and when did we… when did we last actually talk?\", \"different thing, umm, what's my earliest thing on monday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w19-0021\", \"v\": [[\"I need to get back to someone from last week and I can't remember which one it was, so could you pull up Thanis for me?\", \"Right, it's the Hezaino one I'm after — can you give me their contact details so I can reach out?\", \"Totally different thing, I was showing my sister some pics earlier and got curious — what's the most recent picture I took?\", \"Hang on, before I lose the thought, can you show me the shots from Podale Gardens? I promised to send some to a friend.\", \"Okay, back to that photo from before — I want to share the whole set, so which album is it in?\", \"Also my plans have shifted a bit this week, so could you bump the crumpet a day later for me?\"], [\"Could you please pull up Thanis for me?\", \"The Hezaino one, please — would you mind sharing their contact details?\", \"On another subject, could you tell me what the most recent picture I took is?\", \"Sorry, just quickly — could you show me the shots from Podale Gardens?\", \"Returning to that earlier photo, would you tell me which album it's in?\", \"Separately, would you mind moving the crumpet a day later, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w19-0022\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to work out how many tickets we'll need to sort, so for the Adele — who's actually coming?\"], [\"Regarding the Adele, could you tell me who is coming, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w19-0023\", \"v\": [[\"umm the Adele thing… when is that again?\"], [\"Adele — when?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w19-0024\", \"v\": [[\"I'm getting my paperwork together for the accountant and I know there was something, so could you find the granite documents for me?\", \"Great, and what about bennash while you're at it?\", \"Hang on, quick one while I think of it — what time is the tugboat thing?\", \"Anyway, going back to the bennash stuff, is there anything on it in my to-do list too?\"], [\"find my granite documents\", \"what about bennash?\", \"wait quick one what time's the tugboat thing\", \"ok back to the bennash stuff, anything in my to-do list?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w19-0025\", \"v\": [[\"um how much did I spend… like back in May, how much was that?\", \"oh and can you put, uh, drinks with Ivor in the calendar, next monday at one?\"], [\"I'm trying to figure out whether my spending's crept up this year, so how much did I spend back in May?\", \"Different thing — Ivor and I finally agreed on a time after going back and forth forever, so can you add drinks with Ivor to my diary next monday at one?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w19-0026\", \"v\": [[\"monday still to do?\", \"delete every tearooms picture\", \"undo — bring them back\"], [\"Could you tell me what I still need to get done on monday?\", \"Also, would you please delete every tearooms picture I have?\", \"Oh, I'm sorry, I didn't mean to do that — could you bring them back, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w19-0027\", \"v\": [[\"move the night back a day\"], [\"Could you please move the night back a day?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w19-0028\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me what time the Cemzumere is, please?\", \"And the Truzaine, please?\"], [\"Cemzumere time?\", \"and the Truzaine?\"]]}","ttft_ms":11272,"type":"result","duration_ms":28361,"uuid":"fcc62a17-b861-4e94-8935-27e3a596a921","ttft_stream_ms":1457,"time_to_request_ms":166,"first_content_frame_ms":1457,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22168805,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278719292.1907,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
